      "value": "Ideally If this was a name-plate icon have it change (like turning a different color) depending on how much you are muted from them.\nAs its possible to set the range to 1 meter with 100% mute but also at a 10 meter diameter with just 10% lower volume reduction for out-of-range players.\nWould be good to know if a person is ignoring you or just cant hear you from the earmuff feature.",
